est:"300M DAU × 2 posts = 600M posts/day ≈ 7k/s. Feed reads: 300M × 20 = 6B/day ≈ 70k/s, peaks 200k/s. Timeline cache: 300M users × 500 post IDs × 8 B ≈ 1.2 TB in Redis (shard it; keep only active users).",
