deep:[["Routing and fallback","Model aliases (default-small, default-large) map to provider models; on 429/5xx/timeouts retry with backoff then fall back to the next provider in the chain. Circuit breaker per provider."],["Limits and budgets","Token-bucket rate limits per key and per provider quota in Redis; monthly budgets tracked from token usage in responses; soft alerts at 80%, hard block at 100%."],["Streaming","Proxy SSE streams through; count tokens as they pass for billing."],["Caching","Exact-match cache for deterministic (temperature 0) requests; provider prompt caching for long shared prefixes. Avoid semantic caching across users with different permissions."],["Observability and safety","Trace ID per call, latency/error/cost per team and model; optional PII redaction; prompt/response retention rules."]],
